  "vulnerability_information": "in hackerone according to the documentation https://docs.hackerone.com/en/articles/8490190-domain-verification only an organization admin could add verified domain .but there is an bypass.\n\nsteps to reproduce:\n1. create an sandbox\n2.remove org admin permission(you must add program admin permission before removing org admin) \n3. go to the url\n      https://hackerone.com/<program you are admin of>/domain_ownerships/new\n4.from there you will be able to add verified domain in the org\n\n## Impact\n\naccess of restricted feature\nprivilage escalation",
